<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - TBNs - three 140,000 tonnes cargoes coal Bolivar/Stignaes and Asnaes $5.95 fio 40,000 shinc/20,000-30,000 shinc Aug 1997-Mar 1998 SK Power.</p>
<p>TBN - 70,000 tonnes coal Bolivar/Dunkirk $9.20 fio 35,000 shinc/25,000 shinc 15-30/12 Cetragpa.</p>
<p>ORE -  Mount ASthos - 130,000 tonnes ore Saldanha/Beilun $8.80 fio scale load/20,000 shinc 15-30/12 Great Chance.</p>
